ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJYJJNdvwiHISaNLlzw3w1cRWgXbz_yLhKdidnHLxkBuw&oe=6AAD3CDA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Porta360-preview-image-big.png", "id": "1107774098251680", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825305_1107774101585013_1398149668813918986_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0NFC8GKz0c8Q7kNvwGsoWtr&_nc_oc=AdorRahWOxCCSD_lJH5BnvY5cLQovOAMxih_-UyL5dK4lQLL_kPvYtfvfA-_7Xgrbdg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLXDA6AOYdPkm5bR3VyImYt95DjSOioPdnBj6SbW0pPXg&oe=6AAD5512"}, "display_name": "Porta360", "keywords": ["stream", "travel", "Movies", "Cinema", "Video360"], "long_description": "# Travel the World in VR \u2014 No Borders, No Language Barriers!\n\nTransform your VR headset into a personal teleport and explore the globe from home. Experience high-quality **360\u00b0 video** capturing the atmosphere and beauty of iconic locations worldwide.\n\nOur project has officially launched! We begin with our first showcase location to introduce the core experience, with a commitment to regularly adding new cities, historical sites, and natural wonders over time.\n\n### Key Features & Highlights\n\n* **The World Speaks Your Language:** No foreign audio or distracting subtitles. Our system supports almost every language, delivering commentary in your native tongue.\n* **Immersive Ambient Sound:** Enjoy authentic spatial background audio\u2014from vibrant city streets to soothing nature\u2014for a 100% realistic feel.\n* **Growing Content:** Be among the first to explore new updates as we continuously film and add fresh international locations.\n* **Optimized for Standalone VR:** Designed specifically for VR headsets to ensure smooth playback and comfortable viewing.\n* **Intuitive Controls:** Easily pick your language and navigate destinations using simple controller interactions.\n\n### Perfect For\n* **Travel Enthusiasts** wanting to preview destinations or explore remotely.\n* **Relaxation & Escape** after a long day\u2014step into peaceful, exotic atmospheres instantly.\n* **Cultural Discovery** in an engaging, interactive format.\n\n*Put on your headset, choose your language, and start your journey today!*\n{993522363699444}\n{1771700827200401}", "short_description": "Travel Anywhere in VR \u2014 No Borders, No Language Barriers!\n\nTransform your VR headset into a personal teleport. Experience high-quality 360\u00b0 videos with full immersion and realistic ambient atmosphere.\n\nKey Highlights:\n\nYour Language First: Unique audio system supporting almost every world language. Enjoy stories and facts natively\u2014no subtitles needed.\n\nAtmospheric Sound: Authentic ambient audio creates a true 100% presence.\n\nGrowing Library: Starting with our first location, we\u2019re regularly addi"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://porta360.pp.ua/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Sokolov Oleksandr", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://porta360.pp.ua/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}, {"id": "726368587961803"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "sq", "ar", "hy", "az", "zh_CN", "hr", "cs", "da", "nl", "et", "fi", "fr", "ka", "de", "el", "hi", "hu", "it", "ja", "kk", "ko", "lv", "lt", "mk", "pt", "ro", "sr", "sk", "sl", "sv", "tr", "uk"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "27348874701377316"}}]}, 